    "immediate": true,
    "output": "jev-pilot switches (/jev <name> on|off, /jev all on|off, /jev reset):\n  on   effort     sets the reasoning effort of each turn\n  on   raise      raises the effort when tool calls keep failing\n  on   subagents  picks each subagent’s model and effort\n  on   skills     picks the one skill a prompt needs (off: the full skill list stays)\n  on   strategy   advises splitting big work across subagents\n  on   quality    asks before guessing, tests bugs first, checks costly changes, and steps back when a turn goes in circles\n  on   design     gives UI design work your design skills, a real product’s DESIGN.md or Mobbin screens for direction, and the web guidelines to check against\n  off  model      switches the main conversation’s model (resets the prompt cache)\n  on   pet        shows Claude the pilot above the prompt\nalso: /jev status (the crew and its health) · /jev mode <name> · /jev tune (changes learned from your turns)\n\nthis session: nothing decided yet"
